      "indexEndpoint": "https://api.nandaindex.org/api/v1/index",
      "parameters": {
        "q": "search required, trimmed length at least 2"
      },
      "pagination": "Search SQL LIMIT 50; count equals returned rows, not total. No page, offset or cursor. Index returns the entire active list without pagination. Client limit must be explicitly local truncation, never presented as remote paging.",
      "auth": "Public reads, no credentials used in probes.",
      "rateLimit": "Source registers rate limiting with global:false and public read routes do not opt in; upstream infrastructure limits not established.",
      "identity": "org_id identifies an index record. identifier is optional. Results include catalogs, skills, cards and DNS pointers; not all are agents/runtimes.",
      "url": "registry_url may be null and is a discovery destination, not automatically an invocation endpoint.",
      "version": "version is optional in source schema; absent from these samples. updated_at is observed record update time."
    },
